==Description==
The Founder's Pack was the version of the game availible for purchase during [[:Category:Closed Beta Patch|Closed Beta]]. There are three tiers of the pack, Wanderer (USD 34.99), Explorer (USD 54.99), and Captain (USD 64.99). Each pack contains the previous tiers items.
{{clear|left}}
=Packs=
==Wanderer==
The Wanderer pack (USD 34.99) adds the following items:
* Full Game
* Closed Beta Access
* Test Server Access
* 500 Atlas coins<ref>https://www.worldsadrift.com/blog/how-virtual-currency-is-changing-in-worlds-adrift/</ref>
* Worlds Adrift Official Soundtrack
* [[Capulca Mk.2|Capulca Mk.2 Engine]]
<br>
==Explorer==
The Explorer pack (USD 54.99) adds the following items in addition to the items included in the Wanderer pack:
* Founder's Profile Icon<ref name="Coming Soon">Coming Soon</ref>
* [[Claw of Kusiman|Founder's Plaque]]
* [[Flags#Flag of the New Empress|New Empress Flag]]
* [[Flags#Flag of the 151st Contub of Essedari|Essedari Flag]]
* [[Clothes#Clawscarf of Capulca|Founder's Headscarf]]
* [[Figureheads#Clawspirit of Kusiman|Founder's Figurehead]]
<br>

==Captain==
The Captain pack (USD 64.99) adds the following items in addition to the items included in the Wanderer and Explorer packs:
* [[Sails#kusiman's sail|Founder's Sail]]
* [[Helm#founder's helm|Founder's Helm]]
* Your Name In Game <ref name="Coming Soon" />
* Twitch Streamer Pack
* Art of Worlds Adrift

<br>

